; Lines that start with `*` or `#` inside a transaction (#474). In a beancount file they are
; postings flagged `*` and `#`, as beancount reads them; bean-check 3.2.3 accepts this file.
; posting-flags-star-hash-zhang reads the same text as a zhang file, where they are comments.
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2020-01-01 commodity USD

2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Food
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Drinks
2020-01-01 open Equity:Opening

2020-01-02 * "Opening"
  Assets:Cash  100 USD
  Equity:Opening

2020-01-10 * "Lunch"
  Assets:Cash  -10 USD
  Expenses:Food
  * Assets:Cash  -5 USD
  # Expenses:Food  5 USD

2020-01-11 * "Dinner"
  Assets:Cash  -20 USD
  Expenses:Food  20 USD
  # Assets:Cash  -7 USD ; a drink
  *	Expenses:Drinks  7 USD

2020-01-12 balance Assets:Cash  58 USD
2020-01-12 balance Expenses:Food  35 USD
2020-01-12 balance Expenses:Drinks  7 USD
